-    //! If required, you can tweak <code>BOOST_PROPERTY_TREE_RAPIDXML_STATIC_POOL_SIZE</code>, <code>BOOST_PROPERTY_TREE_RAPIDXML_DYNAMIC_POOL_SIZE</code> and <code>BOOST_PROPERTY_TREE_RAPIDXML_ALIGNMENT</code> 
