-        <TD>A <A HREF="../concepts/blocking.html">Blocking</A> <A HREF="../concepts/device.html">Device</A> whose <A HREF="../guide/modes.html">mode</A> refines that of <CODE>T</CODE>.</TD>
-    </TR>
-</TABLE>
