-<A NAME="inverse"></A>
-<H2>Class Template <CODE>inverse</CODE></H2>
-
-<A NAME="inverse_template_params"></A>
-<H4>Template parameters</H4>
-
-<TABLE STYLE="margin-left:2em" BORDER=0 CELLPADDING=2>
