@@ -1,94 +0,0 @@
-[/
- / Copyright (c) 2008 Marcin Kalicinski (kalita <at> poczta dot onet dot pl)
- / Copyright (c) 2009 Sebastian Redl (sebastian dot redl <at> getdesigned dot at)
